        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AWSS is a first person shooter with low-poly graphics and dark atmosphere. A Nightmare of bullets and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 types of  weapons with different attachments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-good shooting mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Maps with open areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Low-poly cartoonish visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-gloomy atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-upgrade system for player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a team of mercenaries hired to retrieve a high-value data case from a contaminated zone. Fight through hostile forces, infiltrate the secure laboratory, and fight your way to the extraction point.</p>",
